      "description": {
        "fun": "A tiny bird with a huge attitude, Rookidee will pick a fight with anything, however big, and even a defeat leaves it a little stronger. Females are fussier than males: dirty a female Rookidee's wings and it will peck you relentlessly. Hitoshi Ariga designed the whole line, from this tit-like chick to the armoured Corviknight.",
        "guide": "A small Flying-type bird of Galar, modelled on tits such as the blue tit. Rookidee bravely challenges any opponent and grows a little stronger from every battle, even a loss. It evolves into Corvisquire and then Corviknight.",
