      "description": {
        "fun": "A brainy crow that uses tools in battle, flinging rocks and tying up foes with vines or rope. Its brain is large for a bird Pokémon's, and hard battles have taught it to size up an opponent before it engages. Its tool use may nod to the New Caledonian crow, famous for the same trick.",
