      "description": {
        "fun": "The strongest bird in Galar's skies, armoured in steel feathers like a black knight, also runs the region's Flying Taxi service. In Paldea it can't do the job: Tinkaton pelt it with rocks mid-flight, so taxis there use Squawkabilly instead. Its look may draw on the ravens kept at the Tower of London.",
        "guide": "The final evolution of Rookidee, a large steel-armoured raven said to be the strongest bird Pokémon in Galar. Corviknight carries passengers for the region's Flying Taxi service. It has a Gigantamax form.",
